{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55597","headline":"野游 · 延寿","name":"野游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独步出衡茅，寒云着地交。\n烧平多败穴，叶落见危巢。\n（见南宋钱唐陈起《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷中，《南宋羣贤小集》第二十五册，嘉庆六年石门顾氏读画斋刊本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}